    <preface>
      <p>Law Courts (Sydney) Act 1977</p>
      <p>No. 22 of 1977</p>
      <p>An Act relating to the Transfer of certain Land in Sydney to Law Courts Limited and the exemption of that Company from certain Taxation</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1  Short title	1</p>
